# Same project as the environment this panel manages — copy the values from
# the main app's EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL / EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY for
# whichever Supabase project (staging or production) this deployment targets.
# Never put the service_role key here — it belongs only in the admin-users
# Edge Function's secrets, never in anything shipped to a browser.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
